DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Was ich dich fragen wollte,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Kommst du auch
heute Nacht?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Heute ist {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}das heißt, der
Mond wird heute Nacht besonders
schön sein.
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Und wo könnte man den Mond
besser sehen als in {{TAG:0005:0005:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
direkt hinterm Mond! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hazır aklıma gelmişken—bugün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Bizim için epey önemli bir bayramdır.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Hakkında pek bir şey biliyor musun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Eh, harikadır,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} bilmen gereken de aşağı yukarı
bu kadar!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡No te he dicho nada de la comida!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hay unos pasteles de arroz
que se llaman "songpyeon"{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
y se parecen a la luna.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Por eso los comemos siempre
en la festividad del {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}¿O ya te lo había dicho?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ha, aklıma gelmişken! Sende güzel bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fotoğraf
makinesi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} varmış.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Güzel fotoğraf makineleri ne işe yarar biliyor
musun? {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ay'ın güzel fotoğraflarını çekmeye! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hasta que no llega el {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
no tengo la sensación de que
sea otoño de verdad.
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}La luz de la tarde es más cálida{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
y me invade una paz interior{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡o alguna chorrada de esas!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} gelince,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sonbaharın nihayet
geldiğini hissediyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}
İnsanın içine tatlı bir huzur veriyor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Evet evet, ben de düzenli bir şairim
işte... ne saçmalıyorsam.
